  "editorial": {
    "name": "codaworks/react-glow",
    "descriptionZh": "一个只做一件事的 React 小组件库：让组件跟随鼠标位置发光。装一个包，用 GlowCapture 套住、Glow 标出哪些子元素要亮。只响应鼠标，触摸事件不触发。",
    "takeawayZh": "装 @codaworks/react-glow 加鼠标跟随发光",
    "noteZh": "仓库 h1 是 React glow，README 第一句就是 Add a mouse-tracing glow effect to React components. 并注明 The glow effect will only work using the mouse as the pointer. Touch events will not trigger it.。用法是外层套 <GlowCapture> 追踪鼠标位置，里面每个 <Glow> 自己决定发光时长什么样，子元素用 glow: 变体（例如 glow:bg-red-100）改样式，颜色通过 CSS 变量 --glow-color 暴露。Tailwind 用户要加载 @codaworks/react-glow/tailwind 插件，不用 Tailwind 的走 Vanilla CSS 那节；README 末尾还有 How does it work? 和 Attribution。About 写着 No description, website, or topics provided，只给 MIT license，Star 739、Used by 340。",
    "recommendation": null,
    "pricing": "Free",
    "pricingNote": null
  },
